" ghpr setup  7/7 Review                                                         "
"Write this config?                                                              "
"↑↓ scroll the file; Back changes an answer.                                     "
"                                                                                "
"Writes ~/.config/ghpr/config.toml.                                              "
"Backs up the current file first, next to it (config.toml.bak-<time>).           "
"Moves seen/snoozed/muted state ~/.local/state/ghpr/state.json →                 "
"~/.local/state/ghpr/profiles/work/state.json (it was collected with gh's active "
"account, me-work).                                                              "
"                                                                                "
" Write    Back    Cancel                                                        "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"┌ config.toml ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│setup_version = 1                                                             │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│[profiles.work]                                                               │"
"│gh_user = "me-work"                                                           │"
"│default = true                                                                │"
"│team_reviews.teams = ["acme/old"]                                             │"
"│bots = ["deploy-svc"]                                                         │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" ↑↓ PgUp PgDn scroll · ←→ choose · Enter confirm · Esc back                     "
